2. In this Order —
“Map 1 footpath” means any footpath delineated by the black‑coloured line in Map 1 set out in the First Schedule;
“Map 2 footpath” means any footpath delineated by the black‑coloured line in Map 2 set out in the First Schedule;
“Map 3 footpath” means any footpath within the areas bounded by the black‑coloured lines and shaded in Map 3 set out in the First Schedule.
